      en: ["Norwich Cathedral spire is 96 meters high, the second tallest in the UK.", "Norwich Castle was founded as a Norman fortification between 1066 and 1075.", "Elm Hill is a famous and well-preserved medieval cobbled street.", "Norwich was the first English city to be named a UNESCO City of Literature in 2012.", "The city's market has remained in its current location for over 900 years.", "For several centuries, Norwich was the second largest city in England after London."],
