      en: ["Chester has the most complete city walls in Britain.", "The city was founded as Deva Victrix in 79 AD.", "'The Rows' are unique 13th-century two-level shopping arcades.", "The city's Roman amphitheater is the largest in the UK.", "Chester Racecourse (The Roodee) dates back to 1539.", "The Eastgate Clock is the most photographed clock after Big Ben."],
