      en: ["Rugby League was founded in 1895 at the George Hotel in Huddersfield.", "Huddersfield Railway Station was constructed between 1846 and 1850.", "The town has the third highest concentration of listed buildings in the UK.", "The Huddersfield Narrow Canal contains the Standedge Tunnel, the UK's longest.", "The University of Huddersfield was formally established in 1992.", "Castle Hill is an Iron Age hillfort site overlooking the town."],
